{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Apples Gone Wild Simulator 2025</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u201cThe fruit of science has gone too far.\u201d</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091490/extras/db3b1c400aa778f45ee27c61738b5dbc.avif?t=1761547347\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091490/extras_big/db3b1c400aa778f45ee27c61738b5dbc.webp?t=1761547347 width=1560 height=208 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i><strong>Apples Gone Wild Simulator 2025</strong></i>, a 2D apple-tree genetics where apples develop new body parts, questionable mutations, and maybe a podcast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a humble seed and discover how far \u201cscientific curiosity\u201d can go before nature starts laughing back.<br><br>Grow trees, evolve their DNA over generations, and uncover bizarre apple mutations with unique traits and behaviors. Each gene changes how the tree grows from trunk thickness and root angles to fruit color, apple with eyes and even personality. Challenge yourself to create an apple that can <i><strong>sing! fly! wink!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you create an apple that can sing, others might stare, and a few might simply exist in confusion. Your job? Keep experimenting and see what kind of weird ecosystem you can accidentally create.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091490/extras/53b3c1d611f203240895babd9f45ec8f.poster.avif?t=1761547347\" width=404 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091490/extras/53b3c1d611f203240895babd9f45ec8f.webm?t=1761547347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091490/extras/53b3c1d611f203240895babd9f45ec8f.mp4?t=1761547347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091490/extras/2a179394a7ca7a77ce9800bed4187204.avif?t=1761547347\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091490/extras_big/2a179394a7ca7a77ce9800bed4187204.webp?t=1761547347 width=1560 height=177 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genetic Sandbox Simulation</strong>:\u00a0Evolve traits like Branch Length, Growth Speed, Root Depth, and Fruit Genes to discover strange and hilarious results.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Evolution System</strong>:\u00a0Every apple carries DNA variations that influence future generations if you plant them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurdly Advanced Fruit Science</strong>:\u00a0Discover genes like Eye Color, Eye Size, and Fruit Color Spectrum to craft apples that defy biology.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Tree Growth</strong>:\u00a0Branches split, curve, decay, and grow based on their genome.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox &amp; Experiment Mode</strong>:\u00a0No rules, no limits \u2014 only science gone completely bananas (well, apples).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Mutations &amp; Discoveries</strong>:\u00a0Unlock rare traits, record your findings, and maybe discover an apple that dreams of flying.<br><span class=\"bb_img_